543
00:47:57.551 --> 00:48:00.873
Yeah, yeah.
My lucky day.

544
00:49:31.165 --> 00:49:33.976
<font color="#0080ff"><i>Happy Birthday
-Dad</i></font>

545
00:49:51.566 --> 00:49:53.367
What the...

546
00:49:58.093 --> 00:49:59.922
