and they're hunting me.

574
00:52:18.407 --> 00:52:21.537
We need to go
our separate ways, okay?

575
00:52:21.562 --> 00:52:24.013
Take all your knowledge of these
woods and these mountains

576
00:52:24.038 --> 00:52:26.592
