- Read this.

601
00:53:52.657 --> 00:53:53.903
Ha!

602
00:53:54.520 --> 00:53:56.488
Not another step,
I'm warning you.

603
00:53:56.513 --> 00:53:58.299
Back off.

604
00:53:58.379 --> 00:54:01.830
Back off!
I mean it!

605
00:54:07.069 --> 00:54:09.221
Next time
you wanna shoot anyone,

606
00:54:09.223 --> 00:54:11.716
